<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ASX TRADING HALT-Pasminco Ltd.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ASX TRADING HALT-Pasminco Ltd.</headline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares halted pending announcement or commencement of trading on Monday, September 16</p>
<p>Last trade A$1.84 on Sept 12 (steady)</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
